{
  "bodyHash": "7abec11cfe2062e3",
  "content": "<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_3e63cb7e-30cf-4305-a868-85f4719ee261.png\"></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>Outbreak 旨在将受其他媒体启发的末日怪物加入 Minecraft。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>主要特性：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>是<strong>僵尸末日整合包</strong>的完美补充！</li>\n<li><strong>爆头！</strong>击中怪物的头部可以将其击杀。</li>\n<li><strong>时尚盔甲！&nbsp;</strong>在清除这些可憎之物时保持酷炫。</li>\n<li><strong>轻量级！</strong>该模组仅添加了生物和几套盔甲。</li>\n<li><strong>可配置！</strong>可以通过配置文件调整生物的生命值和伤害。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>目前已添加的主题：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Killing Floor（杀戮空间）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>建议搭配 <span style=\"color:#67879c\"><strong><a style=\"color:#67879c\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless&amp;Classics (TaCZ)</a></strong></span>, <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-lesraisins-tactical-equipements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LesRaisins Tactical Equipements</a></strong></span>, <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Extra Gore</strong></a></span></p>\n<p>需要安装 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>‼</strong><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f1c40f\">如果您发现与此模组相关的任何错误，请随时在评论区报告，我会尽快修复它们。</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong> </strong><strong>‼</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c844bf26-95db-43e4-ab62-3827f5b6ca70.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">生物：</strong></h1>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>小型类 // **微不足道**</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong>囊肿 (Cyst)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_3e328143-e0d9-41f9-b8b1-7edac4ac7b2e.png\" width=\"266\" height=\"380\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c0f0d9cb-f2a6-49f5-8af5-d7008cc4e064.gif\" width=\"387\" height=\"516\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong>血块 (Clot)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_211c980f-976f-437e-82a2-00ffcdefd8fa.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"379\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_bb4d5105-e4f2-4e2f-9b17-7c6a122163b0.gif\" width=\"282\" height=\"376\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">囊肿和血块生命值较低，但会成群出现。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>血腥快跑者 (Gorefast)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0cec0985-ff88-4cb1-acf0-59b5eaae0fd6.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"368\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_5b3eb865-6f7b-4b16-9b6f-b309b9dc8cdd.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"533\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">血腥快跑者移动迅速，使其更难瞄准。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>爬行者 (Crawler)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_e7bbe29b-d9d1-41d4-889a-44cfa665ae7d.png\" width=\"390\" height=\"341\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_71bae653-b7cb-4fe3-9510-c7eb604a534d.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">爬行者像蜘蛛一样攀爬墙壁，拥有更小的碰撞箱，其黑色的皮肤使它们在黑暗环境中成为威胁。</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#727e5e\"><strong>潜伏者 (Stalker)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_1ac4f4c6-65aa-4b4c-8cd6-3a6083ded0b9.png\" width=\"351\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_8cfe5568-099c-43e9-bcaf-d7480f3cf339.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">潜伏者几乎100%隐形，只有在足够近并试图抓住你时才会显现。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">注意漂浮的白色眼睛，或者 alternatively，穿戴福斯特伪装 (Foster's Facade) 以揭示周围所有的潜伏者。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#8bbb3d\"><strong>喷射者 (Spitter)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_cc8dca8a-a20b-4075-aa7c-274fe66013e2.png\" width=\"401\" height=\"490\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_aa9c3299-a182-4058-993f-a8de096652dd.gif\" width=\"521\" height=\"694\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">正如名字所示，喷射者会吐出有毒的粘液，这些粘液会在落地后短暂停留。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">这些女性角色可以在相当远的距离发动攻击，利用侧步移动以避免持续伤害 (DOT)。</p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>中型类 // **中等威胁**</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#cbbc80\"><strong>膨胀者 (Bloat)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_20bbf106-630f-4dcb-ab20-92e2f31a7b98.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"491\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_55863e36-e75d-41a3-81a2-1779fee5f931.gif\" width=\"381\" height=\"508\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">膨胀者会吐出酸液来毒害你。如果受到过多攻击，它们膨胀的腹部会爆炸，优先攻击它们的头部以避免爆炸。</p>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>枯尸 (Husk)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_96e809fa-d52e-46c5-87b4-be30280ed789.png\" width=\"378\" height=\"451\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_fa876fa6-e523-4cc6-a664-7576342233f0.gif\" width=\"468\" height=\"624\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">枯尸是远程攻击者，会在远处发射火球，当它们忙于瞄准时尝试侧向移动。</p>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b19492\"><strong>塞壬 (Siren)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_7a767e0e-d729-47d6-ba77-363c92c33022.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"467\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_ef7effc9-eeae-408a-bf6a-3efb832440a1.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">塞壬发出刺耳的尖叫，击中周围360度范围内的所有目标。如果不迅速处理，它们的伤害会迅速叠加。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">装备斯科利面具 (Scully's Mask) 可使使用者免疫塞壬的尖叫。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>大型类 // **极度危险**</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#405ca1\"><strong>斯克雷克 (Scrake)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_13b99890-c1b0-4f90-97ae-36faa61127f2.png\" width=\"390\" height=\"402\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_2437990b-1404-45aa-8042-71a2ba1e7622.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"408\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_3ff83b61-c545-4445-960f-70171058f29b.gif\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">斯克雷克是狂怒的怪物，它们手持电锯向你冲锋。在交战前务必保持距离，因为它们在被击杀前能承受大量伤害。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>女巫 (Witch)</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_436c5d23-77c7-493e-a927-e4de62115f1a.png\" width=\"226\" height=\"322\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_5d842e96-35f4-4eed-a66f-f1fe4c3513b5.gif\" width=\"357\" height=\"357\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">不要被它脆弱的表象所迷惑，这种实体以极端和毫不妥协的敌意而闻名。幸运的是，保持距离可以帮助人们避免被它锋利的双手夺去生命的悲剧结局。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c47070\">血肉巨兽 (Fleshpound)</span></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_7f62d5e6-d820-40b5-af00-c38eeb412f20.png\" width=\"620\" height=\"604\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_d53ac45b-e8a2-4a3c-a301-a698a01e5d29.gif\" width=\"450\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">这座被称为血肉巨兽的高大恐惧存在速度极快、防御力极高，会将挡在它面前的一切撕成碎片，不建议直接接近。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">相反，设置陷阱来 immobilize 它们，或组队交战以确保生存。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">炸药对血肉巨兽也非常有效。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h1><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c0b2cb11-f207-49f8-9727-21f7dd9e576f.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">物品：</strong></h1>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>生物样本 (Bio Sample)：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_26fb4c28-2cb5-4148-b1c3-cf4d65260abe.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">由该模组中的大多数怪物掉落，怪物越大，掉落的生物样本越多。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>生物织物 (Bio Fabric)：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_44dbbae5-8743-41ba-a68d-58b947e66072.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">通过将生物样本与线合成制作。用于装备制作。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">合成配方：</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_78c94348-f8fd-4058-abd3-ab3357347bd8.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>盔甲碎片 (Armor Scrap)：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_7d88beb4-8c85-4879-a853-cf2f02d7873e.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">通过击杀<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>大型</strong></span>怪物获得。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h1><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_dbd3fdb9-4e8d-4c9d-a6f2-b74aa26a4bb3.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">盔甲：</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#727e5e\"><strong>Броня Хорзина Марк 7:</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_73d96b6a-4001-4356-8ace-9b4bc1098220.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cfe41b68-23cc-4499-9b3f-e29970e7f388.png\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Рецепт:</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_318a6993-f908-4f68-a013-635932ddaf90.png\" width=\"450\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_94109505-c205-491b-92f9-b350a908dcad.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_47139f92-a9c4-4414-851b-f3e5df68302f.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_34fca0dc-1768-49c9-b006-8a12a8e1a5bd.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>Костюм диджея Скалли:</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_bc9d9dd3-8080-47b3-b45d-0ce09a7d5a92.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"504\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_ec7a0f59-05a0-4552-8395-d27fa5487003.png\" width=\"269\" height=\"498\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Рецепт:</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_5498bf1e-c96c-4bd8-b32b-0af167fd244c.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_266864c2-84c1-4d77-9daa-d498505227e1.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_a50009b5-0ab7-426a-a9a5-02817a68db65.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"223\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c907b8e2-1238-4d0f-a5a3-3e3897761ffe.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong>Рабочий обмундирование плавильщика:</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_0e231c1d-bd7f-43c9-8d2b-86c7c9de13f1.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"541\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Рецепт:</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_92379f07-9f72-4915-8adc-f7cb5387e159.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_fa337db8-93b8-4c60-9cac-12eaffeca027.png\" width=\"450\" height=\"225\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_a3cd0b92-ab57-4479-bd54-41927a35a91f.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_73ef2ad1-d20d-4c35-a8c9-e1a880a2690f.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"223\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong>Костюм мистера Фостера:</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c818bdb8-811d-4583-aaf7-23857989f87d.png\" width=\"280\" height=\"571\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c6ed2e79-5c67-470a-871b-6c71284b6c9b.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"568\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Рецепт:</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_d3d89494-f931-4c82-b62a-8e5d53d74b09.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"223\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_305162db-129d-4fc2-a1d8-b3b6339f45c2.png\" width=\"450\" height=\"225\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_ff44b888-cf3e-4736-aa35-ecf7be442cd9.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"></p>\n</div>",
